@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5140

### Lista miast (seed)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/cities
Accept: application/json

### Salony w mieście (cityId z /api/cities)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/Barbershops?cityId=1
Accept: application/json

### Profil salonu
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/Barbershops/1
Accept: application/json

### Dostępność barbera (serviceId z profilu salonu, data RRRR-MM-DD)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/Barbers/1/availability?serviceId=1&date=2026-05-10
Accept: application/json

### Rejestracja (Swagger: potem Authorize Bearer)
# POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "fullName": "Jan", "email": "jan@test.pl", "password": "Haslo123", "confirmPassword": "Haslo123" }

### Moje rezerwacje (nagłówek Authorization: Bearer {{token}})
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/Bookings/me
Accept: application/json

### Zmiana terminu (JWT). newDay = dzień w PL; newStartUtc = slot z GET .../availability (ISO UTC)
# PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/Bookings/1/reschedule
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "newDay": "2026-05-12", "newStartUtc": "2026-05-12T06:30:00Z" }

### Development — konta demo (appsettings.Development.json → Demo:*)
# Admin: admin@local.dev / AdminDev1!
# Właściciele: wlasciciel.salon{Id}@dev.barbershop.local / OwnerDev1! (pierwsze 3 salony wg Id)
# Barberzy: pierwsza litera imienia + nazwisko + .{idBarbera} @ dev.barbershop.local, hasło BarberDev1!
# Klient demo: klient.demo@dev.barbershop.local / KlientDev1!

### Panel salonu (JWT: Administrator lub Właściciel danego salonu; rezerwacje także Barber)
# GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/shops/1/services
# GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/shops/1/barbers
# GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/shops/1/bookings

### Moderacja opinii (JWT Administrator)
# GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/reviews/pending
# PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/admin/reviews/1/moderate
# Content-Type: application/json
# { "approve": true }

### Opinie (publiczne zatwierdzone / dodanie jako Klient z JWT)
# GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/Barbershops/1/reviews
